en:
//【茶々丸】
<voice name='茶々丸' class='茶々丸' src='voice/md04/0100490a07'>
//「この遅れで何人無駄に死んだかな」
"A lot of my guys died for nothing."

pt:
//【茶々丸】
<voice name='茶々丸' class='茶々丸' src='voice/md04/0100490a07'>
