en:
//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/md04/0100540a00'>
//「航空戦力を保持しておく方が重要だろう」
"At this point, it's more important to conserve what air power we have left."

pt:
//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/md04/0100540a00'>
//「航空戦力を保持しておく方が重要だろう」
"A esta altura, é mais importante preservar o poder aéreo que ainda nos resta."

en:
//【茶々丸】
<voice name='茶々丸' class='茶々丸' src='voice/md04/0100550a07'>
